{"id":"habilidad","lemma":"habilidad","pos":"noun","rank":1829,"glosses":["ability, skill"],"ipa":"/abiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"habilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-habilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él tiene la habilidad de hacer buenos planes.","en":"He has the ability to make a good plan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932187","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},{"g":"plan","l":"plan"}]},{"text":"Tengo muchas habilidades.","en":"I have many abilities.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué habilidad te gustaría aprender en el futuro?","en":"What’s a skill you’d like to learn in the future?","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to learn"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"future"}]},{"text":"Tom tiene habilidades especiales.","en":"Tom has special abilities.","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"special","l":"especial"}]},{"text":"Confío por completo en sus habilidades.","en":"I completely trust your abilities.","words":[{"g":"to reassure","l":"confiar"},null,null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"completely"]]}]}